<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[min(58vh,640px)] sm:min-h-[62vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1779078878/asii_image_tqav75.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-40" alt="" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#030a16]/92 via-[#030a16]/55 to-[#030a16]/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/45 via-transparent to-[#030a16]/88" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/30 z-[1] pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Responsible Aluminium Production &amp; Sourcing</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">ASI Certification <span class="text-eurogold-400">Services</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-4">Aluminium Stewardship Initiative (ASI) certification by Eurocert Asia  -  responsible production, sourcing, environmental stewardship, and supply chain traceability.</p><p class="text-white/80 text-xs md:text-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">Eurocert Asia supports ASI Performance Standard and ASI Chain of Custody Standard certification across the aluminium industry certification audit journey.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/contact/">Get ASI Certification Support <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white border border-white/15 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all" href="/contact/">Contact Eurocert Asia</a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start"><div class="space-y-6 min-w-0"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Initiative Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">What is the Aluminium Stewardship <span class="text-euro-600">Initiative (ASI)?</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The Aluminium Stewardship Initiative (ASI) is a global non-profit standards and certification organisation that promotes responsible production, responsible sourcing, and sustainability across the aluminium value chain.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">ASI develops internationally recognised sustainability standards for organisations involved in aluminium manufacturing, processing, recycling, sourcing, and supply chain management. Any organisation involved in the aluminium supply chain can become an ASI member and pursue ASI certification.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-industry text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Key sustainability areas</h4></div><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Greenhouse gas emissions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Waste management</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Water stewardship</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Material stewardship</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Biodiversity protection</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Human rights</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Occupational health and safety</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Responsible sourcing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-eurogold-500 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Business ethics and integrity</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="w-full min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start"><figure class="w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1784003409/asi_ft5pjx.png" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="Aluminium Stewardship Initiative (ASI)  -  responsible production certification and global standards" width="1200" height="1200" decoding="async"/></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Support</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">ASI Certification <span class="text-euro-600">Audit Support</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto">Eurocert Asia supports organisations throughout the ASI certification process. ASI certification audits are conducted under Eurocert S.A. Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert S.A., Athens, Greece  -  a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-5 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-industry text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">ASI Performance Standard Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certification focused on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) performance across the aluminium value chain  -  usually the first step in the ASI framework.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-5 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-link text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-3">ASI Chain of Custody Certification</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Certification for responsible sourcing and traceability of aluminium materials throughout the supply chain, supporting sustainability claims and customer requirements.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-10 lg:py-14"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="w-full min-w-0 order-2 lg:order-1 lg:sticky lg:top-24 self-start"><figure class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-black/30 border border-white/10 bg-[#071224]"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1779080259/Screenshot_2026-05-18_102716_bbckib.png" class="w-full h-auto block" alt="ASI certification benefits  -  sustainable aluminium production, recycling, and global supply chain" width="1200" height="1600" decoding="async"/></figure></div><div class="min-w-0 order-1 lg:order-2 space-y-4"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why It Matters</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Benefits of ASI Certification for <span class="text-eurogold-400">Aluminium Companies</span></h2><p class="text-white/50 mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">ASI certification helps organisations demonstrate commitment to sustainability, responsible sourcing, and ESG performance. It is increasingly important for suppliers to global manufacturers, automotive, packaging, infrastructure, and sustainability-focused buyers.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Improved Sustainability Performance</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Demonstrate measurable progress in key ESG and environmental performance areas.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-award text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Enhanced Brand Credibility</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Build trust with customers, investors, and stakeholders through recognised certification.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-seedling text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">ESG &amp; Sustainability Goals</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Support ESG reporting and corporate sustainability commitments.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-eye text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Supply Chain Transparency</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Improve visibility and accountability across the aluminium value chain.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Responsible Sourcing Verification</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Verify responsible sourcing practices and material traceability.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-globe text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Market Acceptance</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Meet customer sustainability requirements in global manufacturing and procurement.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-file-contract text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Customer Compliance</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Meet buyer and procurement sustainability requirements with verified ASI certification.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Environmental &amp; Social Governance</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Strengthen environmental and social governance practices across operations.</p></div></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 flex gap-2.5"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-link text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><div class="min-w-0"><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-[11px] sm:text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 leading-snug">Material Traceability</h4><p class="text-white/50 text-xs leading-relaxed">Improved aluminium material traceability through the supply chain.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">ASI Standards</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Two Main ASI <span class="text-euro-600">Certification Standards</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-8 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-5"><i class="fas fa-industry text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ASI Performance Standard</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Focuses on environmental, social, and governance (ESG) performance across the aluminium value chain.</p><ul class="space-y-2 mb-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Greenhouse gas emissions</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Energy and climate performance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Waste management</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Material stewardship</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Biodiversity and land management</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Human rights protection</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Water stewardship</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Occupational health and safety</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Responsible business conduct</span></li></ul><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed italic border-t border-slate-200 pt-4">Usually the first certification step for organisations entering the ASI certification framework.</p></div><div class="p-8 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-5"><i class="fas fa-link text-lg"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">ASI Chain of Custody Standard</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Focuses on responsible sourcing and traceability of aluminium materials throughout the supply chain.</p><ul class="space-y-2 mb-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Demonstrate responsible aluminium sourcing</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Maintain traceability of aluminium materials</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Support sustainability claims</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Verify responsible supply chain practices</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600"><i class="fas fa-check mt-0.5 text-euro-600 text-xs shrink-0"></i><span>Meet customer sourcing requirements</span></li></ul><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed italic border-t border-slate-200 pt-4">Particularly valuable for organisations supplying aluminium to sustainability-conscious markets and global supply chains.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-24 bg-[#030a16] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute 