-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Most organisations should begin with the <strong class="text-slate-700">ASI Performance Standard</strong> because it establishes sustainability, ESG, environmental, and responsible operational practices across the aluminium value chain.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">After achieving ASI Performance Standard certification, organisations may proceed toward <strong class="text-slate-700">ASI Chain of Custody certification</strong> for responsible sourcing and aluminium material traceability.</p></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why Eurocert Asia</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Why Choose Eurocert Asia for <span class="text-euro-600">ASI Certification?</span></h2><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2 text-sm">ASI certification support for aluminium companies</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-user-graduate"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Experienced Certification Auditors</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Auditors knowledgeable in sustainability standards, ESG systems, management systems, and industrial certification audits.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-white hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font fon