xt-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class="space-y-3"><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What is ASI certification?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">ASI certification is an internationally recognised certification process that helps organisations demonstrate responsible and sustainable practices in the aluminium value chain.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What does ASI stand for?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">ASI stands for Aluminium Stewardship Initiative.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Who can apply for ASI certification?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">Any organisation involved in aluminium manufacturing, processing, recycling, sourcing, or supply chain activities can apply for ASI certification.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What is the ASI Performance Standard?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">The ASI Performance Standard is a sustainability standard focused on environmental, social, and governance practices across the aluminium industry.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>What is ASI Chain of Custody certification?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">ASI Chain of Custody certification supports responsible sourcing and traceability of aluminium materials through the supply chain.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Which ASI certification should we start with?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">Most organisations should begin with the ASI Performance Standard before pursuing Chain of Custody certification.</p></details><details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-5 py-4 shadow-sm open:shadow-md open:border-euro-200 transition-all"><summary class="heading-font cursor-pointer list-none text-sm font-bold text-euro-600 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span>Does Eurocert Asia support ASI certification?</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down text-eurogold-500 text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">Yes. Eurocert Asia supports organisations pursuing ASI certification and certification audit services for applicable ASI standards. ASI certification audits are conducted under Eurocert S.A.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Explore More</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Related Certifications</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><a class="group relative h-[280px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 hover:border-euro-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-500" href="/social-audits/wrap/"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" style="background-image:url(&#x27;https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367921/eurocert/b4.png.png&#x27;)"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradi